From: UN1CA <unica@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the SDK37 forced mobile-AP concurrency override

Inverse of the original MOBILEAP_WIFI_CONCURRENCY enable patch: let the
vendor chip capabilities choose Wi-Fi sharing and Lite mode instead of
forcing concurrent sharing on. Preserve power-save support and interface
selection. The module also changes the SPF_Concurrency diagnostic to false.
---
diff --git a/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali b/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
--- a/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
+++ b/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
@@ -665,10 +665,8 @@
     :cond_3
     :goto_0
-    sput-boolean v5, Lcom/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo;->mSupportWifiSharing:Z
-
     new-instance v2, Ljava/lang/StringBuilder;
 
     const-string v3, "Support power save mode, SEC_PRODUCT_FEATURE_WLAN_SUPPORT_MOBILEAP_POWER_SAVEMODE : true SoftAp_PowerSave : "
 
     invoke-direct {v2, v3}, Ljava/lang/StringBuilder;-><init>(Ljava/lang/String;)V
 
